  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Meanwhile, Qin Xiao arrives at the neighbourhood lounge hoping to meet Chun Yuqiao, only to find PR director Stella and rival department heads venting over evening drinks. Listen to their Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "你好，请给我一杯美式咖啡。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "咖啡是中午喝的，星天的同事晚上到这儿来都是喝酒。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "那我也点一杯酒，星天的同事一般都点什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "斯戴拉姐，你们今晚都在这儿啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "秦助理，你是第一次来这儿吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "知道这里是同事的据点，当然要来看看了，这里还真热闹啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "今天已经算人少了，一部的人都在公司加班呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "现在连三部的几个制片也要跟着一起加班。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "他不就做了一个盛典项目吗，就把自己当老板了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "要我给你再加一点酒吗？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "你好，请给我一杯美式咖啡。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello, one Americano coffee please.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "咖啡是中午喝的，星天的同事晚上到这儿来都是喝酒。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Coffee is for midday; Xingtian colleagues come here at night to have drinks.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "那我也点一杯酒，星天的同事一般都点什么？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then I will order a drink too; what do Xingtian staff usually order?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "斯戴拉姐，你们今晚都在这儿啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stella, you are all gathered here tonight.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "秦助理，你是第一次来这儿吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Assistant Qin, this is your first time here, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "知道这里是同事的据点，当然要来看看了，这里还真热闹啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Knowing this is everyone's hangout, of course I came; it is lively here.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "今天已经算人少了，一部的人都在公司加班呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Tonight actually counts as quiet, since everyone in Unit One is working overtime.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "现在连三部的几个制片也要跟着一起加班。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now even several producers from Unit Three have to work overtime alongside them.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "他不就做了一个盛典项目吗，就把自己当老板了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All he took on is one gala project, and he already acts like the boss.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "stella",
      "t": "要我给你再加一点酒吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Shall I top up your glass a little?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "你好，请给我一杯美式咖啡。",
